  "body": "## Scope: measurement only; NO kernel/desktop behavior change\nStacked on held PR38 (`e0bc041024445770aad61fa70824527b0395a58f`). Current head `f2aa0ab`.\n\nAdd direct `epoll_pwait` private-idle-waiter modes to the exact existing pollwakebench: `--epoll`, `--epoll-inotify`, `--epoll-unix`, `--epoll-unix-inotify`. All original four poll modes retained. Each uses 24 private epoll instances, eventfd plus optional inotify, exactly1000 eight-byte unrelated eventfd/Unix transfers, expected eventcount/mask/tag and data validation. Same45-secondalarm/phase diagnostics, no poll fallback/retries/performance thresholds. Appends explicit waiter_api to results.\n\nNative host controls assert all8mode/output identities, reject7invalidCLIforms and independently reject wrongdeliverytag/count mutations. Strengthen invalid-output check to explicitly fail (bare negated grep is exempt from shell errexit), with a synthetic bad-summary control. Wire ALL3 source/signed-prebuilt, root/UID1000, x86SMP8 and sourceMLFQ. No local non-x86 or desktop-library compilation.\n\n## Completed local proof and limitations\n- Native x86 Linux: all8modes,7CLIcontrols,2deliverymutants and invalid-outputguard pass. Existing exact unixpolltest216checks0fail +CLI retained. Final-headhostcontrols pass.\n- Strict x86 musl tinyconsumer compiled; actual installer model/missingflagcontrols pass.\n- ONE predeclared unchanged-kernel x86SMP4/512M core-onlyVM, selectedtwohostCPUs:25/25 accepted (all8modes root/UID1000, existing endpoint/filter/socket/IPC/pollregressions,boot/lockdep0); EVERYbefore/afterfixturehash andwhole-rootmanifest match. Runtime/consumer393a91d, identical atcurrentf2aa0ab (onlyhostguard changed). No VM retry/overlap or activefixturemutation. Full originals evidence-only5551d7e, docs/evidence/m40-epoll-wake-baseline; plan07858e3 committedBEFORElaunch.\n- Readycount/20mssettling isNOTproofeverywaiteractuallyenrolled. Waiterswitchesinclude startup/finalwake; walltime/switches informational, not statisticalrates or GUIcausality. NOT graphics/coldvalidation.\n\n## CURRENT-HEAD CI and integration hold\nCurrent-head ALL3 PR CI pending; no merge until genuine current-head validation plus outstanding integration holds. Source review shows directepoll stillglobal; this PR does not optimize it. A kernelcandidate requires separate lifetime/topology/ET/ONESHOT/signal/epoch scrutiny and exact controls, not benchmark-only confidence.\n\nPR38 fixedcold39063560162 FAILED: acceptedLinux; guestsFAIL8/18,PASS18/18,FAIL8/18; allhashchecksvalid. Only1/3guestaccepted, no reruns/postfailuregate rescue. All originals retained. PR18/wholechainintegrationholds remain, M40unfinished. Evidence/manualvalidationbranchesNEVERmerge; no branchdeletion.\n",
